# ---------------------------------------------------------------- game data
# Warcraft III's archives and the map itself. These are Blizzard's and the map
# author's work, not this project's -- supply your own copy. Everything below
# them is *derived* from them by the pipeline, so it is regenerated rather than
# committed: see the README for the build order.
#
# Note: git takes no trailing comments on a pattern line, so each of these
# stands alone. A pattern written "extracted/  # unpacked map" matches nothing.
*.mpq
*.w3x
*.w3m

# unpacked map: script, object data, imported art
extracted/

# unpacked Warcraft III: models, textures, sounds, SLKs
war3_extracted/

# converted glTF, PNG and OGG
assets/

# the staged client tree
public/

# compiled tables: units, items, abilities, terrain
data/

# the deployable bundle, built by tools/make_serve.py
serve/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- working
node_modules/
.tmp/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.claude/

# screenshots and scratch output from the verification tools
*.png
!docs/**/*.png
